---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Aanmelden op je Chromebook" description="Hoe meld je je aan op je Chromebook op Sint-Victor Alsemberg.">

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Chromebookproject"
    title="Aanmelden op je Chromebook"
    intro="Alles wat je nodig hebt om je aan te melden — geen apart wachtwoord nodig."
    width="4xl"
  />

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">

        <!-- Gebruikersnaam -->
        <div class="scroll-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-card overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-b border-gray-100 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="bg-[#07153b] rounded-lg w-9 h-9 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-yellow-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-[#07153b] text-xl">Gebruikersnaam</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 py-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5">Vul je gebruikersnaam in op het aanmeldscherm. Het gedeelte <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-gray-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">@sintvictor.be</span> wordt automatisch aangevuld.</p>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-4 flex items-center gap-0.5 overflow-x-auto">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[#07153b]">voornaamachternaam</span>
              <span class="text-gray-400 font-mono text-sm">@sintvictor.be</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Wachtwoord -->
        <div class="scroll-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-card overflow-hidden" style="--d:80ms">
          <div class="border-b border-gray-100 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="bg-[#07153b] rounded-lg w-9 h-9 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-yellow-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-[#07153b] text-xl">Wachtwoord</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 py-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Het wachtwoord van je Chromebook is <strong class="text-[#07153b]">hetzelfde als je Smartschool-wachtwoord</strong>. Je hoeft geen apart wachtwoord te onthouden.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Wachtwoord gewijzigd -->
        <div class="scroll-reveal bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4" style="--d:160ms">
          <div class="bg-yellow-400 rounded-xl w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#07153b]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-bold text-[#07153b] mb-1">Wachtwoord gewijzigd?</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-yellow-800 leading-relaxed">Als je je wachtwoord in Smartschool wijzigt, wordt dit automatisch gesynchroniseerd met je <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-white border border-yellow-300 rounded px-1 py-0.5">@sintvictor.be</span>-account en je Chromebook. Dit kan tot <strong>2 uur</strong> duren.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Terug -->
        <div class="pt-6">
          <a href="/chromebookproject" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#07153b] font-semibold text-sm hover:underline underline-offset-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 ease-fluid group-hover:-translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
            </svg>
            Terug naar Chromebookproject
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
